3
00:00:06,610 --> 00:00:10,290
Northern Pakistan has more than three thousand glacial lakes.

4
00:00:10,530 --> 00:00:13,370
Cloud often hides them from optical satellites.

5
00:00:14,010 --> 00:00:17,690
NASA and ISRO's NISAR radar sees through cloud.

6
00:00:17,930 --> 00:00:22,390
We're SARcastic Scientists from Islamabad. We built SARtale,

7
00:00:22,930 --> 00:00:26,811
an interactive app that maps lake water from every NISAR

8
00:00:26,851 --> 00:00:29,530
pass and compares its area over time.

9
00:00:31,270 --> 00:00:34,530
Lake Watch brings the lakes together. Open Passu,

10
00:00:35,370 --> 00:00:39,420
and see its radar image, its water in blue, and its history.

11
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:43,070
A flag invites a closer look:

12
00:00:43,110 --> 00:00:48,020
Passu's began with a processing update, so it may not be a real change.

13
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:51,020
Anyone can add a lake to follow.

14
